# Portal RBAC

- Nav filter: `PortalLayout.tsx` — `item.roles.includes(currentRole)`
- Server: always use `requireRole(...)` — UI gating is not security
- CO_MENTOR = MENTOR for group scoping (`isGroupMentor`)
- BPMJ: read-only on Jethro placement (no approve/commit in UI)
- COMMITTEE: no Regenerasi Kelompok nav (placement review only)
- Parity matrix: `docs/tech/nav-api-parity.md`
- Staging QA: `npm run db:seed-users:staging`, login `#/login` dengan `*@gehc.demo` / `password123`
